ot;requiresShipping&quot;:true}]\" shop-id=\"73057009775\" enabled-flags=\"[&quot;a1d1f9a1&quot;]\" > <div class=\"shopify-payment-button__button\" role=\"button\" disabled aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"background-color: transparent; border: none\"> <div class=\"shopify-payment-button__skeleton\">&nbsp;</div> </div> <div class=\"shopify-payment-button__more-options shopify-payment-button__skeleton\" role=\"button\" disabled aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div> </shopify-accelerated-checkout> </div>\n  \n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        </div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"product-id\" value=\"15129290014831\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"section-id\" value=\"template--26292851048559__main\" /></form></product-form-component></span>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <rte-formatter class=\" spacing-style text-block text-block--AdnBwNCtqQVBSdWIyR__text_aEtTtq rte    text-block--align-left rte   \"  style=\"    --padding-block-start: 0px; --padding-block-end:0px; --padding-inline-start:0px; --padding-inline-end:0px;         --width: 100%;    --max-width: var(--max-width--body-normal);          --text-align: left;          \">\n    <p>A wireless LED face mask emitting red light at 630nm and near-infrared at 850nm.</p>\n<p>Red light (630nm) is studied for supporting collagen production and evening skin tone. Near-infrared (850nm) reaches deeper, studied to support tissue repair and firmness.</p>\n<h3>Supports</h3><ul>\n<li>Fine lines and wrinkles</li>\n<li>Uneven tone and the appearance of dark spots</li>\n<li>Redness</li>\n<li>Firmness and elasticity</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Use</h3><p>10 minutes, three to five times a week, on clean, dry skin.</p>\n<h3>Format</h3><ul>\n<li>Red 630nm + near-infrared 850nm</li>\n<li>Wireless, rechargeable (3000mAh)</li>\n<li>Flexible fit, four colours</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Notes</h3><p>A cosmetic device, not a medical treatment. Avoid if pregnant, photosensitive, or taking photosensitising medication. Results vary. Ships in approximately two weeks. Fr